Drain sweep across impact generation onset varying alpha0
* Provenance: original Sansho R17 circuit with synthetic parameters.
* sweep: alpha0 0 10u 100u
.param probe=0
Vd d 0 0.95
Vg g 0 .8
Ve e 0 0
Vb b 0 .38
M1 d g 0 e b dev l=.48u w=2.4u
.model dev nmos(level=10 version=4.4 tox=4.6n tsi=75n tbox=105n nch=1.1e17 k1=.42 vth0=.48 u0=.047 alpha0={probe})
.dc Vd .05 1.75 .05
.save i(Vb) i(Vd)
.end
